{"elapsed_ms": 20564, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1163, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["沈鼎", "哟，又醒一个。进来坐，茶刚泡上。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 20845, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1169, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["沈鼎", "我姓沈，沈鼎，烧菜的。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 21030, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1177, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "……霍铎。钳工。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 21129, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1183, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["苏泠", "苏泠。弹琴的。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 21233, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1189, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["沈鼎", "你呢？穿这么一身风衣，不像跑船的。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 21421, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1196, "value": {"actions": ["就叫这个"], "kind": "form", "prompt": "三个人在等你开口。登船之前，你叫什么？", "title": "报上名字"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 21710, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1207, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["侦探", "侦探。……做侦探的。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 21949, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1214, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["沈鼎", "都还记得啥？我就记得上船。下了跳板往后，脑子里白茫茫一片。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 22136, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1221, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["", "（他把茶一杯一杯推过来。推到苏泠面前的那杯，他没有放糖。）"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 22319, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1228, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["苏泠", "……你怎么知道我喝茶不放糖？"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 22504, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1235, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["沈鼎", "嗯？……顺手吧。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 22611, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1241, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["", "（墙上的铜口里咳了一声。屋里四个人一齐扭过头去。）"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 23103, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1249, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "诸位晨安。我是此地的代管者，也是诸位的教师。诸位初涉斯地，记忆有缺，并非伤病，请勿惊惶。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 23289, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1256, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "诸位的报偿，就在铜口下方的领取柜里，各有名签。请亲手核验。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 23474, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1263, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["", "（三人几乎同时走到柜前。沈鼎咬了一枚银元，霍铎把试件举到灯下刮配合面，苏泠摇响了柜旁的试听机。）"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 23661, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1270, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "银元在柜里，沈师傅。粮仓、水窖、灶火，岛上也都有。超越卡诺循环的那一张，此地有人画过，霍先生。此地还有诸位从未听过的声音，苏小姐。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 23848, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1277, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["侦探（心声）", "柜上有一格贴着我的名字。小门开着，里面什么也没有。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 24033, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1285, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["侦探", "那我的呢？"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 24143, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1291, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "与你立约的，不是我。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 24247, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1297, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["沈鼎", "……钱是真的。这活我接着干。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 24435, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1304, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "我留下。那张图，我得找。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 24626, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1311, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "昨夜警铃骤起。主楼曾有人向诸位呼喊。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 25033, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1318, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "通往主楼之门，在诸位这一侧闩上了。那人再没有回来。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 25213, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1325, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "此为始业之问：门是谁闩上的？闩门之时，此人可曾听见门外的呼喊？"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 25400, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1332, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "记不得，并不妨碍作答。痕迹还在。答案备好了，到铜口来。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 25583, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1339, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["", "（三人各自散开：霍铎守在铜口旁，苏泠去了门厅，沈鼎回了备餐间。）"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 26067, "kind": "screenshot", "sequence": 1355, "value": {"entered": "hall", "feet_region": "活动厅", "file": "0013-decision.png", "interior": true, "position": [448.0, 200.0], "room_region": "hall", "token": "player:1e4462de91574ec09dc537304e0ab3d0:1221", "turn": 5914.0, "visible_region": "活动厅"}}
