{"elapsed_ms": 26439, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1378, "value": {"kind": "sound"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 26439, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1379, "value": {"facts": "铜口嵌在活动厅北墙上，下方铜牌刻着一个符号：◎。\n一根铜管从铜口后面出来：一路沿北墙向西，穿墙进门厅，贴着墙下到隔离门的门框；另一路向东，钻进活动厅与 R-08 之间的墙里。\n那道墙上与门框北侧各有一个管接头，一碰就晃——接口松了。", "kind": "card", "notes": [], "options": ["返回现场"], "source": "活动厅北墙铜口 · 活动厅与 R-08 之间的墙 · 隔离门北侧门框", "title": "铜口与管接头"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 26904, "kind": "screenshot", "sequence": 1392, "value": {"entered": "hall", "feet_region": "活动厅", "file": "0014-decision.png", "interior": true, "position": [492.0, 153.0], "room_region": "hall", "token": "player:1e4462de91574ec09dc537304e0ab3d0:1268", "turn": 6113.0, "visible_region": "活动厅"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 26906, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1396, "value": {"kind": "candidates", "options": ["检视铜口与铜牌", "回答始业之问", "返回现场"], "prompt": "铜口静静地嵌在墙上。铜牌上的 ◎ 擦得发亮。", "title": "铜口"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 26973, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1402, "value": {"kind": "music"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 26983, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1403, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "请讲，侦探先生。我一句一句地问。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 27171, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1411, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "每一问，请阁下说一句结论，再拿出一件撑得住它的东西。说错了不要紧——我只指出它说明的是别的事。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 27351, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1418, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "我只问我问过的。我所说的每一句，诸位都可以拿来对质。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 27545, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1425, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "门，是谁闩上的？"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 27714, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1431, "value": {"actions": ["陈述", "出示", "暂且不答", "作答"], "kind": "form", "title": "始业之答"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 27901, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1437, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "不急。答案备好了，再来。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 28043, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1443, "value": {"kind": "music"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 28156, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1445, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["铜口", "此为始业之问：门是谁闩上的？闩门之时，此人可曾听见门外的呼喊？"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 28828, "kind": "screenshot", "sequence": 1459, "value": {"entered": "hall", "feet_region": "活动厅", "file": "0015-decision.png", "interior": true, "position": [492.0, 153.0], "room_region": "hall", "token": "player:1e4462de91574ec09dc537304e0ab3d0:1319", "turn": 6551.0, "visible_region": "活动厅"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 28888, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1465, "value": {"kind": "sound"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 28888, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1466, "value": {"facts": "一块小石板，粉笔速记两行。\n第一行：G：⊥门 ✕开 ◎\n第二行：一个小小的放大镜图样，后面是“⊥✓”。", "kind": "card", "notes": [], "options": ["收起物件", "毁坏物件", "返回现场"], "source": "活动厅 · 长桌东端", "title": "霍铎的石板"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 29132, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1475, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "这东西动过了。原来什么样，我记得。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 29240, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1482, "value": {"kind": "aside", "text": "一块小石板，粉笔速记两行。\n第一行：G：⊥门 ✕开 ◎\n第二行：一个小小的放大镜图样，后面是“⊥✓”。"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 29565, "kind": "screenshot", "sequence": 1490, "value": {"entered": "hall", "feet_region": "活动厅", "file": "0016-decision.png", "interior": true, "position": [492.0, 181.5], "room_region": "hall", "token": "player:1e4462de91574ec09dc537304e0ab3d0:1360", "turn": 6738.0, "visible_region": "活动厅"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 29571, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1494, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "……什么事。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 29628, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1500, "value": {"choices": ["我屋里架子上有半枚手印。借你的手去比一比？", "这个铜口是什么？", "那根铜管的接头。", "石板上的字。", "我们会不会早就在这里一起生活过？", "昨晚你在哪？", "没事了。"], "kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "你问。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 29793, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1506, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "石板？在长桌上？我没注意。……走，我去看。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 30502, "kind": "screenshot", "sequence": 1520, "value": {"entered": "hall", "feet_region": "活动厅", "file": "0017-decision.png", "interior": true, "position": [492.0, 181.5], "room_region": "hall", "token": "player:1e4462de91574ec09dc537304e0ab3d0:1404", "turn": 6907.0, "visible_region": "活动厅"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 30504, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1524, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "嗯。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 30558, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1530, "value": {"choices": ["我屋里架子上有半枚手印。借你的手去比一比？", "这个铜口是什么？", "那根铜管的接头。", "石板上的字。", "我们会不会早就在这里一起生活过？", "昨晚你在哪？", "没事了。"], "kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "你问。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 30727, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1536, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "不记得。只记得上船。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 30831, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1542, "value": {"choices": ["我屋里架子上有半枚手印。借你的手去比一比？", "这个铜口是什么？", "那根铜管的接头。", "石板上的字。", "我们会不会早就在这里一起生活过？", "昨晚你在哪？", "没事了。"], "kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "你问。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31018, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1548, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "传声口。主楼那边说话，这边听。图纸上这么画。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31206, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1555, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "管子往门厅走。我看过墙。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31394, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1563, "value": {"choices": ["我屋里架子上有半枚手印。借你的手去比一比？", "这个铜口是什么？", "那根铜管的接头。", "石板上的字。", "我们会不会早就在这里一起生活过？", "昨晚你在哪？", "没事了。"], "kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "你问。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31652, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1570, "value": {"kind": "aside", "text": "霍铎现在正忙，等他做完眼前的事，再当面邀请。"}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31743, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1571, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "……我的字。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31799, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1577, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "G，一个人。我记人，先写他的头一个字母。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 31992, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1584, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "⊥，闩。✕，禁止。✕开，不许开。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 32165, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1591, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "◎……不确定。图纸上见过这个记号。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 32361, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1599, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "下面这行。小图代人，我习惯这样——画他手里常拿的家伙。⊥✓，闩好了。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 32540, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1606, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "这个图……我认不出是谁。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 32738, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1613, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "它说的是真的。我想要超越卡诺循环的动力图纸。碰一下，就知道了。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 32921, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1620, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["", "（他把手掌平放在石板上。）"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 33104, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1627, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["", "（粉笔灰沾了他一手。）"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 33255, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1634, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "铜口里的声音……很清楚。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 33435, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1642, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "“等我下一次通知。”◎，铜口。他叫我守铜口。"]]}}
{"elapsed_ms": 33616, "kind": "shown", "sequence": 1649, "value": {"kind": "lines", "lines": [["霍铎", "……他再也没有来。"]]}}
